const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"上交所统计年鉴是覆盖市场概况、指数、交易、上市公司、会员、投资者与大事记的官方年度参考资料。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The Shanghai Stock Exchange yearbook is an official annual reference for the exchange's market overview, price indices, trading, listed companies, members, investors, and major events. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://www.sse.com.cn/aboutus/publication/yearly/",label:{zh:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · 来源说明",en:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它是按卷编制的统计出版物，不是因果研究或实时数据流；所选卷次及其统计定义决定可比范围。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It is a compiled statistical publication, not a causal study or a point-in-time market-data feed; the selected volume and its definitions determine the comparison. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://www.sse.com.cn/aboutus/publication/yearly/",label:{zh:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · 来源说明",en:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"应记录所选卷次、覆盖年度、表格定义、发布日期、计量单位、修订说明与市场分部，不能在没有口径对应表的情况下混合不同版本。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"Use the chosen volume's tables, coverage year, classification definitions, publication date, units, revisions, and market-segment scope rather than combining values across editions without a crosswalk. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://www.sse.com.cn/aboutus/publication/yearly/",label:{zh:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · 来源说明",en:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"该资料提供交易所统计的结构化描述参照，不能据此判断单只证券、当前市场状态或某项制度变化的因果效果。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The archive supports a structured descriptive reference to exchange statistics, not a claim about a security, a current market state, or the causal effect of any market change. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://www.sse.com.cn/aboutus/publication/yearly/",label:{zh:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · 来源说明",en:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"记录卷次和覆盖年度；保留表名、单位、分部与脚注；区分年度总量和日频数据；保留发布时间与访问日期。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Record the volume and coverage year; preserve table title, unit, segment, and footnotes; separate annual aggregate figures from daily data; and retain publication and access dates. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://www.sse.com.cn/aboutus/publication/yearly/",label:{zh:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · 来源说明",en:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 SSE Statistical Yearbook archive。年度统计不能替代证券级、日内或实时记录，后续卷次也可能调整前一卷使用的定义或覆盖范围。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites SSE Statistical Yearbook archive. Annual exchange statistics cannot replace security-level, intraday, or real-time records, and a later volume can revise definitions or coverage used by an earlier one. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://www.sse.com.cn/aboutus/publication/yearly/",label:{zh:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · 来源说明",en:"SSE Statistical Yearbook archive · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“SSE Statistical Yearbook”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。年度统计不能替代证券级、日内或实时记录，后续卷次也可能调整前一卷使用的定义或覆盖范围。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “SSE Statistical Yearbook”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
